---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---
<BaseLayout
  title="About Skill Foundry | Practical Skills Platform"
  description="Skill Foundry helps people understand practical digital skills, learn how tools and workflows work, and create independently."
  canonical="https://hub.skillfoundry-web.workers.dev/about/"
>
  <div class="about-page">
    <section class="about-hero">
      <div class="about-container">
        <h1 class="about-title">Practical skills. Real understanding. Independent creation.</h1>
        <p class="about-lead">Skill Foundry helps you understand useful digital skills, learn how tools and workflows work, and turn that knowledge into something you can create and apply independently.</p>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="about-body">
      <div class="about-container">
        <div class="about-content">
          <section class="about-section-block">
            <h2>Why Skill Foundry exists</h2>
            <p>Technology is evolving quickly, bringing new tools, possibilities and ways to work. But having access to powerful tools does not automatically mean knowing how to use them effectively.</p>
            <p>Many people follow tutorials, copy prompts and repeat workflows without understanding the decisions behind them. When something changes or does not work as expected, they can struggle to adapt.</p>
            <p>Skill Foundry exists to bridge that gap by turning useful skills and techniques into clear, practical learning experiences.</p>
          </section>

          <section class="about-section-block">
            <h2>How we help you learn</h2>
            <p>We believe learning should go beyond following instructions. Every workflow should help you build understanding, practise a process and become capable of adapting it.</p>

            <div class="about-learning-grid" aria-label="Skill Foundry learning approach">
              <article class="about-learning-card">
                <h3>Understand</h3>
                <p>Learn the concepts, tools and techniques behind a process.</p>
              </article>
              <article class="about-learning-card">
                <h3>Execute</h3>
                <p>Follow practical instructions and learn through real examples and projects.</p>
              </article>
              <article class="about-learning-card">
                <h3>Adapt</h3>
                <p>Modify what you have learned to suit your own needs, goals and projects.</p>
              </article>
            </div>
          </section>

          <section class="about-section-block">
            <h2>What you’ll find here</h2>
            <p>Skill Foundry brings together practical learning resources in formats that help turn ideas into real work.</p>

            <div class="about-formats-grid" aria-label="Types of learning resources">
              <article class="about-format-card">
                <h3>Practical tutorials</h3>
                <p>Clear explanations that guide you through useful tasks.</p>
              </article>
              <article class="about-format-card">
                <h3>Step-by-step blueprints</h3>
                <p>Structured workflows that show how a process fits together.</p>
              </article>
              <article class="about-format-card">
                <h3>Prompts and tool guidance</h3>
                <p>Understand the choices behind the tools and instructions you use.</p>
              </article>
              <article class="about-format-card">
                <h3>Creative workflows</h3>
                <p>Combine techniques to develop practical results of your own.</p>
              </article>
            </div>

            <p class="about-growth-copy">The focus is on helping you create, solve problems, improve everyday work and turn ideas into practical results. As the library grows, it will cover more tools, techniques and skill areas that help people stay capable and adaptable.</p>
          </section>

          <section class="about-section-block about-section-last">
            <h2>Our approach to practical learning</h2>
            <div class="about-trust-panel">
              <h3>Personally tested through actual execution.</h3>
              <p>We aim to make every published resource useful, understandable and actionable. Every published resource is personally tested through actual execution before it is published.</p>
              <p>Instructions are designed to explain the process, not just reproduce an output. The goal is to help you develop skills you can continue using, improving and adapting beyond a single tutorial.</p>
            </div>
          </section>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>
  </div>
</BaseLayout>

<style>
  .about-page {
    min-height: 80vh;
    padding-bottom: 0;
  }

  .about-container {
    width: min(780px, calc(100% - 48px));
    margin-inline: auto;
  }

  /* Match the section rhythm used on Resource pages without stacking
     the shared About body padding on top of the global CTA padding. */
  :global(.about-body) {
    padding-bottom: 0 !important;
  }

  :global(.about-page + .sf-global-cta) {
    padding-top: 36px !important;
  }

  :global(.about-section-block h2) {
    margin: 0 0 14px !important;
  }

  :global(.about-section-block p) {
    margin: 0 0 14px !important;
  }

  :global(.about-section-block p:last-child) {
    margin-bottom: 0 !important;
  }

  .about-trust-panel h3 {
    margin-bottom: 14px;
  }

  .about-trust-panel {
    margin-top: 8px;
  }

  .about-trust-panel p + p {
    margin-top: 14px !important;
  }

  .about-trust-panel p:last-child {
    margin-bottom: 0 !important;
  }

  /* The shared page stylesheet controls hero and body spacing. */
  .about-page.about-page .about-content {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 0 !important;
  }

  .about-learning-grid {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: repeat(3, minmax(0, 1fr));
    gap: 14px;
    margin-top: 18px;
    width: 100%;
  }

  .about-learning-card,
  .about-format-card,
  .about-trust-panel {
    box-sizing: border-box;
    min-width: 0;
    background: var(--sf-page-surface, #0B0D12);
    border: 1px solid var(--sf-page-border, rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08));
    border-radius: 14px;
    box-shadow: none;
  }

  .about-learning-card {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 8px;
    padding: 20px 18px;
    min-height: 132px;
  }

  .about-learning-card h3,
  .about-format-card h3 {
    margin: 0;
    color: var(--sf-page-heading, #F5F5F5);
    font-family: 'Plus Jakarta Sans', -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, "Segoe UI", sans-serif;
    font-size: 15px;
    font-weight: 700;
    line-height: 1.35;
    letter-spacing: -0.01em;
  }

  .about-page.about-page .about-learning-card p,
  .about-page.about-page .about-format-card p {
    margin: 0 !important;
    color: var(--sf-page-copy, #A1A9B6) !important;
    font-family: 'Plus Jakarta Sans', -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, "Segoe UI", sans-serif !important;
    font-size: 13.5px !important;
    line-height: 1.58 !important;
  }

  .about-formats-grid {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: repeat(2, minmax(0, 1fr));
    gap: 12px;
    margin-top: 18px;
    width: 100%;
  }

  .about-format-card {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 7px;
    padding: 18px 16px;
  }

  .about-trust-panel {
    margin-top: 4px;
    padding: 22px 20px;
  }

  .about-trust-panel h3 {
    margin: 0 0 10px;
    color: var(--sf-page-heading, #F5F5F5);
    font-family: 'Plus Jakarta Sans', -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, "Segoe UI", sans-serif;
    font-size: 16px;
    font-weight: 750;
    line-height: 1.4;
    letter-spacing: -0.015em;
  }

  .about-page.about-page .about-trust-panel p {
    margin: 0 0 12px !important;
    color: var(--sf-page-copy, #A1A9B6) !important;
    font-family: 'Plus Jakarta Sans', -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, "Segoe UI", sans-serif !important;
    font-size: 14px !important;
    line-height: 1.65 !important;
  }

  .about-trust-panel p:last-child {
    margin-bottom: 0;
  }

  .about-growth-copy {
    margin-top: 16px !important;
  }

  @media (max-width: 640px) {
    :global(.about-page + .sf-global-cta) {
      padding-top: 24px !important;
    }

    .about-trust-panel {
      margin-top: 6px;
      padding: 18px 16px;
    }

    .about-trust-panel h3 {
      margin-bottom: 12px;
    }

    .about-container {
      width: min(780px, calc(100% - 32px));
    }

    /* Zero the flex gap so the shared divider and its padding are the
       single source of vertical spacing between editorial sections. */
    .about-page.about-page .about-content {
      gap: 0 !important;
    }

    .about-learning-grid {
      grid-template-columns: 1fr;
      gap: 12px;
      margin-top: 15px;
    }

    .about-learning-card {
      min-height: 0;
      padding: 18px 16px;
      gap: 6px;
    }

    .about-formats-grid {
      grid-template-columns: repeat(2, minmax(0, 1fr));
      gap: 10px;
      margin-top: 15px;
    }

    .about-format-card {
      padding: 16px 13px;
      gap: 6px;
    }

    .about-learning-card p,
    .about-format-card p {
      font-size: 13px;
      line-height: 1.55;
    }

    .about-trust-panel {
      padding: 18px 16px;
    }

    .about-growth-copy {
      margin-top: 14px !important;
    }
  }

  @media (prefers-reduced-motion: reduce) {
    .about-learning-card,
    .about-format-card,
    .about-trust-panel {
      scroll-behavior: auto;
      transition: none;
    }
  }
</style>
